flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> A[Authorized user opens Reports module]
    A --> B[Select report type, date range and filters]
    B --> C[Submit report request]
    C --> D[Authenticate user and validate token]
    D --> E{Authorized to generate report?}
    E -- No --> F[Record denied report request]
    F --> END([End])
    E -- Yes --> G[Validate filters and date range]
    G --> H{Request valid?}
    H -- No --> I[Return validation errors]
    I --> B
    H -- Yes --> J[Query incidents, evidence metadata and camera events]
    J --> K[Query audit and chain-of-custody records]
    K --> L[Aggregate statistics and analytics]
    L --> M{Sensitive information included?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Apply role-based masking and redaction]
    M -- No --> O[Generate structured report]
    N --> O
    O --> P[Assign report ID, author and timestamp]
    P --> Q[Calculate SHA-256 report hash]
    Q --> R[Digitally sign report]
    R --> S[Store report metadata and secure file reference]
    S --> T[Write report-generation audit event]
    T --> U{Requested output?}
    U -- View --> V[Render report in dashboard]
    V --> END
    U -- Export --> W[Create protected PDF or CSV export]
    W --> X[Generate time-limited download link]
    X --> Y[Write report-export audit event]
    Y --> Z[Provide secure download]
    Z --> END
